===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|pistelarie}}, from {{der|en|la|epistolārium}}, from {{m|la|epistola||letter}} (English {{m|en|epistle}}) + {{m|la|-ārium}}, from {{der|en|grc|ἐπιστολή}} from {{m|grc|ἐπιστέλλω||I send a message}} from {{m|grc|ἐπί||upon}} + {{m|grc|στέλλω||I prepare, send}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|Christianity}} A Christian liturgical book containing set readings for church services from the [[New Testament]] [[Epistle]]s.

